...................................\r\n   ........................................\r\n=== r3 c6  color=B cnt=566 lum=13 ===\r\n   ........................................\r\n   ........................................\r\n   ........................................\r\n   ........................................\r\n   ........................................\r\n   ........................................\r\n   ........................................\r\n   ........................................\r\n   .................####...................\r\n   ................#####...................\r\n   .................####...................\r\n   ...............#######..................\r\n   ..............####.####.................\r\n   ..............##......#.................\r\n   ...............###.####.................\r\n   ................######..................\r\n   ................######..................\r\n   ................######..................\r\n   ...............#######..................\r\n   ..............#########.................\r\n   .............###########................\r\n   ............#############...............\r\n   ........................................\r\n   ........................................\r\n   ........................................\r\n   ........................................\r\n   ........................................\r\n=== r3 c7  color=W cnt=416 lum=251 ===\r\n   ........................................\r\n   ........................................\r\n   ........................................\r\n   ........................................\r\n   ........................................\r\n   ........................................\r\n   ........................................\r\n   ........................................\r\n   .................###....................\r\n   .................#..#...................\r\n   .................###....................\r\n   ................######..................\r